  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AI生活服务会员合成问卷离线结果展示页</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#f4f7fb;color:#17233b}
body{margin:0;padding:24px;line-height:1.5}
main{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}
h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 8px}
h2{font-size:21px;margin:28px 0 12px;border-bottom:2px solid #dbe3ef;padding-bottom:6px}
section{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(18,25,43,.06)}
.meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#43546d}
.meta span{background:#eef3fb;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px}
.badge{display:inline-block;border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-left:6px;background:#e2e8f3;color:#334155}
.badge.generated{background:#fff1d6;color:#8a5a00}
.badge.fact{background:#dff3e4;color:#1f5b38}
.badge.assumption{background:#fdeaea;color:#8a2929}
.notice{background:#fff8e6;border:1px solid #f2d27a;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin:12px 0;color:#5c4a00}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px}
.card{background:#f9fbfe;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px}
.qcard{background:#f9fbfe;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;margin:12px 0}
.qhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap}
.qtitle{font-weight:650;font-size:15px}
.denom{flex:none;font-size:13px;color:#43546d;background:#eef3fb;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px}
.choice{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #dbe3ef;font-size:14px}
.count{font-weight:700;color:#0b4ea2;white-space:nowrap}
.note{color:#5f6f89;font-size:13px}
button{background:#0b4ea2;color:white;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}
button:hover{background:#083b7c}
.table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px}
th,td{border:1px solid #dbe3ef;padding:7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
th{background:#eef3fb}
code{background:#eef3fb;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:6px}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #dbe3ef;margin:18px 0}
.small{font-size:12px;color:#64748b}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>AI生活服务会员合成问卷离线结果展示页</h1>
<div class="meta">
  <span>问卷ID：<span id="run-id">0a3adcb9-6b85-40ae-b6b7-1a8f88ef8705</span></span>
  <span>模式：<span id="mode">live</span></span>
  <span>来源：<span id="provenance">generated</span></span>
  <span>时点：<span id="period">2020-11-01</span></span>
  <span>区域：binjiang</span>
  <span>版本：<span id="dataset-version">2026-09-23.1</span></span>
</div>

<section>
  <h2>数据口径与合成标识</h2>
  <div class="notice" id="simulation-notice"><strong>合成数据声明：</strong>本页展示的是实际模型逐人新会话生成的合成答卷，不是规则演示或真人样本；不构成滨江人口占比或真实购买率，不构成市场结论。</div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">有效答卷 <strong id="valid-count">12</strong></div>
    <div class="card">计划答卷 <strong id="planned-count">12</strong></div>
    <div class="card">结构有效 <strong id="structurally-valid-count">12</strong></div>
    <div class="card">失败 <strong id="failed-count">0</strong></div>
    <div class="card">未开始 <strong id="not-started-count">0</strong></div>
  </div>
  <p class="small">有效分母为12，与 planned 12、structurallyValid 12、failed 0、notStarted 0 一致。覆盖抽样无总体权重；15+人口框包含未成年人。</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>全部15题统计</h2>
  <div id="all-questions"></div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>街道分组切换</h2>
  <button id="next-group">切换到下一街道</button>
  <div id="group-summary"></div>
  <p class="small">街道分组在 西兴/长河/浦沿 之间循环切换。有效分母不能变；组内分母为4。</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>条件追问转移表</h2>
  <div class="notice"><strong>非独立实验：</strong>以下两张表为同一问卷内的条件追问交叉表，不是独立随机实验；不把“保持原选择”折算为某固定套餐，不推断真实市场因果。</div>
  <div id="comparison-standard-price"></div>
  <div id="comparison-family-benefit"></div>
</section>

<section id="limitations">
  <h2>研究限制</h2>
  <p><strong>不代表滨江真人市场偏好</strong>：本页所有统计仅描述这12份合成答卷，不是滨江人口占比或真实购买/成交数据。</p>
  <ul>
    <li>text 开放题（ai-uses、purchase-concerns、trial-intent-reason）仅报告分母12且 missing 0，无内容编码或主题归纳。</li>
    <li>覆盖抽样无总体权重；年龄、资格、画像说明与行为均为显式假设，不支持总体外推。</li>
    <li>15+人口框包含未成年人，不等同于有购买资格的成年人。</li>
    <li>城市人口数据仅为2020年七普背景口径，非问卷统计结果。</li>
    <li>自洽检查仅覆盖已登记硬规则（street-profile、age-profile），未做真人校准、完整人格效度或措辞/重复作答验证。</li>
    <li>如需独立价格实验、单属性反事实、跨街道因果或真人验证，均超出本交付范围。</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>来源与背景口径</h2>
  <p class="small">城市人口数据为 fact：2020年滨江区常住人口 503859 人，15岁及以上 434827 人。西兴街道 143318 人，长河街道 168276 人，浦沿街道 192265 人。仅为背景口径，不参与合成答卷统计。</p>
</section>
</main>

<script>
(function(){
  "use strict";

  function esc(t){
    var d = document.createElement('div');
    d.textContent = t == null ? '' : String(t);
    return d.innerHTML;
  }

  function renderChoices(q, includeDenom){
    var choices = q && q.choices ? q.choices : [];
    return choices.map(function(c){
      return '<div class="choice" data-option="' + esc(c.id) + '"><span>' + esc(c.label) + '</span><span class="count">' + esc(c.count) + '</span></div>';
    }).join('');
  }

  function renderQuestion(q, showDenom){
    var denomHtml = showDenom === false ? '' : '<div class="denom" data-stat="denominator">分母 ' + esc(q.denominator) + '</div>';
    var head = '<div class="qhead"><div class="qtitle">' + esc(q.questionId) + ' · ' + esc(q.prompt) + '</div>' + denomHtml + '</div>';
    if(q.type === 'text'){
      return '<div class="qcard" data-question-id="' + esc(q.questionId) + '">' + head + '<div class="note" data-stat="no-summary">仅有分母，无内容汇总；missing ' + esc(q.missing) + '</div></div>';
    }
    if(q.type === 'scale' || q.type === 'number'){
      return '<div class="qcard" data-question-id="' + esc(q.questionId) + '">' + head + '<div>均值 ' + esc(q.mean) + ' · 中位数 ' + esc(q.median) + ' ' + esc(q.unit || '') + '</div></div>';
    }
    return '<div class="qcard" data-question-id="' + esc(q.questionId) + '">' + head + renderChoices(q) + '</div>';
  }

  function renderQuestions(list, showDenom){
    return list.map(function(q){ return renderQuestion(q, showDenom); }).join('');
  }

  function renderComparison(c){
    var rows = c.transitions.map(function(t){
      return '<tr><td>' + esc(t.beforeLabel) + '</td><td>' + esc(t.afterLabel) + '</td><td>' + esc(t.count) + '</td></tr>';
    }).join('');
    return '<div class="qcard" data-comparison-id="' + esc(c.id) + '"><div class="qhead"><div class="qtitle">' + esc(c.label) + ' · 分母 ' + esc(c.denominator) + '</div></div>' +
      '<div class="interpretation">' + esc(c.interpretation) + '</div>' +
      '<table class="table"><thead><tr><th>第10题前项</th><th>追问后项</th><th>计数</th></tr></thead><tbody>' + rows + '</tbody></table></div>';
  }

  var OVERALL = [
    {questionId:"street",prompt:"在本次设定中，您居住在哪个街道？回答不会更新登记人口事实。",type:"single",denominator:12,missing:0,choices:[{id:"option-1",label:"西兴",count:4},{id:"option-2",label:"长河",count:4},{id:"option-3",label:"浦沿",count:4},{id:"option-4",label:"其他地区",count:0},{id:"option-5",label:"不确定",count:0}]},
    {questionId:"age-range",prompt:"在本次设定中，您的年龄范围是？",type:"single",denominator:12,missing:0,choices:[{id:"option-1",label:"14岁及以下",count:0},{id:"option-2",label:"15–17岁",count:0},{id:"option-3",label:"18–29岁",count:1},{id:"option-4",label:"30–44岁",count:1},{id:"option-5",label:"45–59岁",count:4},{id:"option-6",label:"60岁及以上",count:6},{id:"option-7",label:"不确定",count:0}]},
    {questionId:"occupation",prompt:"在本次设定中，您的职业或就业状态是？",type:"single",denominator:12,missing:0,choices:[{id:"option-1",label:"在职雇员",count:2},{id:"option-2",label:"个体经营/自由职业",count:0},{id:"option-3",label:"学生",count:1},{id:"option-4",label:"退休",count:6},{id:"option-5",label:"暂未就业",count:0},{id:"option-6",label:"其他或不确定",count:3}]},
    {questionId:"household",prompt:"在本次设定中，您的同住家庭情况是？",type:"single",denominator:12,missing:0,choices:[{id:"option-1",label:"独居",count:0},{id:"option-2",label:"与伴侣同住",count:1},{id:"option-3",label:"与孩子同住",count:2},{id:"option-4",label:"多代同住",count:0},{id:"option-5",label:"其他或不确定",count:9}]},
    {questionId:"ai-experience",prompt:"在本次设定中，您是否使用过AI产品？",type:"single",denominator:12,missing:0,choices:[{id:"option-1",label:"经常使用",count:0},{id:"option-2",label:"偶尔使用",count:5},{id:"option-3",label:"试过但已不用",count:0},{id:"option-4",label:"从未使用",count:5},{id:"option-5",label:"不确定",count:2}]},
    {questionId:"ai-uses",prompt:"在本次设定中，您通常使用AI做哪些事情？如果没有使用过或没有明确用途，请如实说明，不必编造用途。",type:"text",denominator:12,missing:0},
    {questionId:"cloud-experience",prompt:"在本次设定中，您是否使用过云存储或照片备份服务？",type:"single",denominator:12,missing:0,choices:[{id:"option-1",label:"经常使用",count:0},{id:"option-2",label:"偶尔使用",count:6},{id:"option-3",label:"试过但已不用",count:1},{id:"option-4",label:"从未使用",count:3},{id:"option-5",label:"不确定",count:2}]},
